From: Ilya I. Nikitin <ilya.i.nikitin@proton.me>
Subject: [PATCH] media roles: remix through a common channel layout

Capture-only stereo positions let the playback side negotiate mono while
the loopback copies only its first channel. Set the common channel layout
so PipeWire remixes stereo before sending it to a mono destination.

--- a/data/media-role-nodes.conf
+++ b/data/media-role-nodes.conf
@@ -22,13 +22,13 @@
     actions = {
       merge = {
         arguments = {
+          audio.position = [ FL, FR ]
           capture.props = {
             # Explicitly mark all these sinks as valid role-based policy
             # targets, meaning that any links between streams and these sinks
             # will be managed by the role-based policy
             policy.role-based.target = true
 
-            audio.position = [ FL, FR ]
             media.class = Audio/Sink
           }
           playback.props = {
